title: Twelve Million on Strike
subtitle: The greatest strike in German history.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_kapp = 1 and crisis_time = 1
max-visits: 1
priority: 5
on-arrival: {!
// some districts drift back to work: fewer where the workers are angry, and where we lead the strike
var back = [];
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (!Q['district_' + d + '_strike']) { continue; }
    var p = 0.3 - Q['district_' + d + '_militancy'] / 250 - 0.05 * Q.e20_kapp_voice + (Q.kapp_statement == 1 ? 0.05 : 0);
    p = Math.max(0.03, Math.min(0.35, p));
    if (Math.random() < p) { RG.endStrike(d, 'quiet'); back.push(Q.district_names[d]); }
}
Q.e20_kapp_back = back.length;
Q.e20_kapp_back_names = back.length ? back.join(' and ') : 0;
RG.district('ruhr', {militancy: 4, guards: 3});
RG.districtSummary();
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Districts on strike: ' + Q.strike_count + ' of 8';
!}

= Twelve Million on Strike

Nothing moves in Germany. No trains, no trams, no post, no gas, no newspapers. Kapp's decrees are printed on handbills because the printers will not set them. The civil servants refuse his orders, and the Reichsbank refuses to pay his officers.

[? if e20_kapp_back = 0 : Not one district has gone back to work. ?][? if e20_kapp_back >= 1 : In [+ e20_kapp_back_names +] the strike is crumbling, and men are drifting back to the works. ?] [? if kapp_statement = 1 : Our statement of the first day is quoted against us at every strike meeting. ?] In the Ruhr armed workers have beaten the Lichtschlag Freikorps at Wetter.

- @all_in: Put everything into keeping the strike united.
- @demands: Raise our own demands inside the strike.
- @armed: Turn the strike into an armed struggle.

@all_in
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Our members keep the pickets and the soup kitchens. One district that went back may come out again.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.e20_kapp_voice = Math.min(2, Q.e20_kapp_voice + 1);
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
var best = null;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (d != 'bavaria' && !Q['district_' + d + '_strike'] && (!best || Q['district_' + d + '_militancy'] > Q['district_' + best + '_militancy'])) { best = d; }
}
if (best) { RG.startStrike(best, true); }
RG.districtSummary();
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Districts on strike: ' + Q.strike_count + ' of 8';
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: ' + ['none', 'heard', 'leading'][Q.e20_kapp_voice];
!}

The union officials, who expected trouble from us, find none.

@demands
subtitle: Disarm the Freikorps, punish the putschists, arm the workers. The USPD left will vote with us.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_kapp_demands = 1;
Q.uspd_score += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

Our resolutions pass at strike meetings across Berlin: no return to work until the counter-revolution is disarmed.

@armed
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Ruhr shows what is possible. The rest of the strike may not follow.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an armed rising.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.kapp_armed = 1;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.district('ruhr', {guards: 3});
RG.district('halle', {guards: 1, repression: 4});
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 1});
!}

The couriers carry one order to the districts: arm, and hold what you take.
